{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "You're not failing in sales because you don't try hard enough. You're failing because you're trying to sell product to someone who is trying to solve a problem.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000001"}], "text": "Successful sales depend on the identity and understanding of the salesperson, rather than on trying to sell products to solve a customer's problem."}, "title": "Salesperson Identity and Success", "topic": "sales_approach"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:3f11de0332c028c2", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Salesperson Identity and Success", "topic": "sales_approach", "topic_slug": "sales_approach"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000029", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000030"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Authority is not the watch, the suit, the LinkedIn title. Authority is your inner position. Equal adult.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000029"}], "text": "Authority is about having an inner position of being an equal adult, not determined by outward appearances like watch, suit, or LinkedIn title."}, "title": "Building Sales Authority", "topic": "sales_approach"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:4c1b6035d668227f", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Building Sales Authority", "topic": "sales_approach", "topic_slug": "sales_approach"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000010"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Client is making a decision whether he will buy with you not because of those things and prices and features of the product. He buys because he feels the pain of his problems and the need to solve them.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000010"}], "text": "Clients make decisions based on their need to solve problems rather than on a salesperson's confidence or luxury items like a Rolex."}, "title": "Client Decision Factors", "topic": "sales_approach"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:3f37f9fd8a873f6a", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Client Decision Factors", "topic": "sales_approach", "topic_slug": "sales_approach"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000019", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000020"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "So the stage number one is unaware, where I literally do not have a problem. And then something happened, I moved to stage number two, the problem aware.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000019"}, {"quote": "Next stage is product aware. So understand this product or that product definitely going to help me. The last stage number five is most aware.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000020"}], "text": "Buyers go through stages of awareness from being unaware of a problem to being most aware, which influences how they interact with salespeople."}, "title": "Stages of Buyer Awareness", "topic": "sales_approach"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:8d3402d6c3d157f6", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Stages of Buyer Awareness", "topic": "sales_approach", "topic_slug": "sales_approach"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000023"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "You're losing most of your deals in the first ten seconds before you even talk about the product. Simply because you never really got the client attention.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000023"}], "text": "Many sales are lost in the first ten seconds because salespeople fail to capture client attention."}, "title": "Client Attention and Sales Success", "topic": "sales_approach"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:2d95c8e1387616bf", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Client Attention and Sales Success", "topic": "sales_approach", "topic_slug": "sales_approach"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000008"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "They're assumed clothes, they're alternative clothes, oh please. That is a puppy dog clothes. They are not magic spells.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000008"}], "text": "Classic sales techniques like the assumed close or alternative close are not effective anymore as they are perceived as manipulative."}, "title": "Ineffectiveness of Classic Sales Techniques", "topic": "sales_approach"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:7772d59d9919faa8", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Ineffectiveness of Classic Sales Techniques", "topic": "sales_approach", "topic_slug": "sales_approach"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000004"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "The Mo Sales people are not failing because they don't know enough about the product. They are failing because they believe the wrong thing about sales.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000004"}], "text": "Salespeople are failing because they believe the wrong thing about sales, not because they lack product knowledge."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Failure in Sales Due to Beliefs", "topic": "sales_approach"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:cases:1edf8188a6ace10e", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Failure in Sales Due to Beliefs", "topic": "sales_approach", "topic_slug": "sales_approach"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000011", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000012"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Build report and make them trust you. So they usually explain that you have to smile, be friendly, use the first name, find something in common, make the client feel comfortable.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000011"}, {"quote": "Your client is not stupid. He knows that it's a sales conversation and you are trying to sell him and he's silently judging every move you make.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000012"}], "text": "Discussion on how traditional methods of building trust by finding common ground or being friendly are no longer effective as buyers are more discerning."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Trust and Modern Sales", "topic": "sales_approach"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:cases:a782108fcb0eb73e", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Trust and Modern Sales", "topic": "sales_approach", "topic_slug": "sales_approach"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000025"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Hi, it's Olga from XYZ company. uh you submitted your inquiry about ABC, how can I help you today? And it's over. The conversation is dead. You do not have their attention.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000025"}], "text": "Salespeople lose potential sales by using generic call openers that fail to capture attention."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Sales Call Opener Issue", "topic": "sales_approach"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:cases:548c387d2894c6ca", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Sales Call Opener Issue", "topic": "sales_approach", "topic_slug": "sales_approach"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000001", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000002", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000003", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000004"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "You're not failing in sales because you don't try hard enough. You're failing because you're trying to sell product to someone who is trying to solve a problem.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000001"}, {"quote": "By the end of this video, you'll understand yourself why your current way of selling is keeping you stuck.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000004"}], "text": "The speaker contrasts a common misconception about sales with their own learned experience, setting up a narrative of transformation from order taker to professional salesperson."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Contrast in Approaching Sales", "topic": "sales_approach"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:expression:98028db2449861ab", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Contrast in Approaching Sales", "topic": "sales_approach", "topic_slug": "sales_approach"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000029"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Here is what almost always misunderstood. Authority is not the watch, the suit, the LinkedIn title. Authority is your inner position. Equal adult.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000029"}], "text": "Authority is not the watch, the suit, the LinkedIn title; it is your inner position as an equal adult."}, "title": "Authority Misunderstanding", "topic": "authority"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:382bb675c1a42e62", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Authority Misunderstanding", "topic": "authority", "topic_slug": "authority"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000030", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000031"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Transactional analysis founded by Eric Bern studied how people communicate and how the position you take in a conversation creates the reaction of the other person.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000030"}, {"quote": "the moment you communicate from dependent position, you start sounding like a child speaking to adult. And your client, he just has no choice but to take the adult position above you.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000031"}], "text": "Transactional analysis founded by Eric Bern aids in understanding how communication positions affect interactions. Communicating from a dependent position aligns you in a child role, prompting the client to assume an adult role above you."}, "title": "Transactional Analysis and Communication Positions", "topic": "transactional_analysis"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:a915c601378b1b46", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Transactional Analysis and Communication Positions", "topic": "transactional_analysis", "topic_slug": "transactional_analysis"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000032"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "From the moment the balance of power is broken, changing its back is not possible. That's why the beginning of conversation is so important.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000032"}], "text": "Once the balance of power in a sales conversation is broken, it cannot be restored. Starting from a dependency leads to client superiority, while starting as an equal sets a professional tone."}, "title": "Balance of Power in Sales Conversation", "topic": "power_balance"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:46ba8e676c0df8a7", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Balance of Power in Sales Conversation", "topic": "power_balance", "topic_slug": "power_balance"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000040"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Internal urgency rooted in his own words. And it keeps growing in his head because it's connected to the problem that he need to solve.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000040"}], "text": "Internal urgency is more effective than external urgency because it continues to influence the client long after the conversation ends."}, "title": "Internal vs External Urgency", "topic": "urgency"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:56bd41a5c0c60e1c", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Internal vs External Urgency", "topic": "urgency", "topic_slug": "urgency"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Because the front camera splits your brain in half.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000051"}], "text": "The front camera should not be used as it divides attention."}], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000048", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000049", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000050", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000051"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "Confidence is strained like a muscle.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000048"}], "text": "To build confidence in sales conversations."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [{"citations": [{"quote": "You have to film yourself on the back camera, not the front one.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000049"}], "text": "Have a back camera to record yourself."}], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "So, you film it, then you watch the video right away.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000049"}], "text": "Film yourself on the back camera for approximately one minute."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "You don't have to do anything. Your brain will do the work.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000050"}], "text": "Review the video and let your brain process the self-feedback."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I'm going to give you two exercises. It's only five minutes a day and it's totally free.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000048"}, {"quote": "So exercise number one, I call it the camera confidence test. It literally takes two minutes.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000049"}], "text": "A camera confidence exercise can help improve sales performance by overcoming self-monitoring behaviors."}, "title": "Confidence Building Exercise", "topic": "camera_confidence"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:bf7f3f72eb5db046", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Confidence Building Exercise", "topic": "camera_confidence", "topic_slug": "camera_confidence"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [{"citations": [{"quote": "If in the moment that you hit the send, your stomach tightens...you just borrowed an adult sentence.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000056"}], "text": "The message should not show desperation or over-eagerness."}], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000055", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000056"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "I've seen my coaching client bring back leads that went silent for months just using this exact line.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000056"}], "text": "To reactivate leads that have gone silent after initial contact."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Hi, name? I know life can get busy. Have you completely given up on the idea of making money with Dubai real estate?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000055"}], "text": "Craft a follow-up message that challenges the client to reconsider their decision without sounding desperate."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "The trick is this, no one wants to admit that he is completely given up on anything.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000056"}], "text": "Using a pattern interrupt can reactivate leads that have gone silent by avoiding typical follow-up messages."}, "title": "Use of Pattern Interrupt", "topic": "pattern_interrupt"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:fabf90c9f10a59d4", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Use of Pattern Interrupt", "topic": "pattern_interrupt", "topic_slug": "pattern_interrupt"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000029"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Authority is not the watch, the suit, the LinkedIn title. Authority is your inner position. Equal adult.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000029"}], "text": "The claim of authority is structured by juxtaposing commonly perceived indicators (watch, suit, LinkedIn title) against the true indicator (inner position) with an imperative conclusion (Equal adult)."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Claim of Authority", "topic": "authority"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:expression:8eb142992b2fb7b1", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Claim of Authority", "topic": "authority", "topic_slug": "authority"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000030"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Transactional analysis founded by Eric Bern studied how people communicate and how the position you take in a conversation creates the reaction of the other person.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000030"}], "text": "Transactional analysis is explained by first attributing its founding to Eric Bern, followed by describing its use in communication analysis."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Explanation of Transactional Analysis", "topic": "transactional_analysis"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:expression:7d455f2ce1a0686f", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Explanation of Transactional Analysis", "topic": "transactional_analysis", "topic_slug": "transactional_analysis"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000036", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000037", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000038", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000039", "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000040"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Internal urgency rooted in his own words...grows for days after you hang up.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000040"}], "text": "The speaker contrasts internal and external urgency by explaining how internal urgency's impact extends beyond immediate interactions, while external urgency's influence dissipates quickly."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Urgency Explanation", "topic": "urgency"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:expression:d5c75e4ee615e7f8", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Urgency Explanation", "topic": "urgency", "topic_slug": "urgency"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000057"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "If after this video, you are still thinking, I'm not a natural salesperson, replace that with a sentence. I can design a system that works for me and I can become the perfect person for the system.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000057"}], "text": "If you feel you are not a natural salesperson, replace that thought with 'I can design a system that works for me and I can become the perfect person for the system.'"}, "title": "Camera confidence and personal identity in sales", "topic": "sales_identity"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:641f3f83dbd823cc", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Camera confidence and personal identity in sales", "topic": "sales_identity", "topic_slug": "sales_identity"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000058"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "industries change. The buyer changes, the script changes, the identity behind the salesperson does not.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000058"}], "text": "The identity behind the salesperson does not change even if the industry, buyer, or script changes."}, "title": "Identity behind the salesperson", "topic": "sales_identity"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:c95d60b2d4b51356", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Identity behind the salesperson", "topic": "sales_identity", "topic_slug": "sales_identity"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000058"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "the way you showed up to every sales conversation is the actual product the client is buying.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:u000058"}], "text": "The way you show up to every sales conversation is the actual product the client is buying."}, "title": "Impact of personal identity on sales", "topic": "sales_identity"}, "content_hash": "291c0ae3bd40938494a5a9d553abd9d7535dab35744f245fd6f533362906bd88", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9:knowledge:935edb1dd8be18ee", "metadata_hash": "b6c841e37bcef74dc974689573686e0769616e8e1a79b2e791bb4ee00543c57b", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-05-26", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "9189db95580e86427ea88e070f5337f6dc23a032495831b11b60be960d933286", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-05-26-the-sales-techniques-nobody-teaches-because-they-actually-wo-b31a69b6e9", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSM6H191dh4", "title": "Impact of personal identity on sales", "topic": "sales_identity", "topic_slug": "sales_identity"}
